@page "/docs/components/toast"

<Seo Canonical="/docs/components/toast" Title="Blazorise Toast Component" Description="Learn to use and work with the Blazorise Toast component, a lightweight notifications designed to mimic the push notifications that have been popularized by mobile and desktop operating systems." />

<DocsPageTitle Path="Components/Toast" AddedVersion="1.5" AddedDate="2024-03-02">
    Blazorise Toast component
</DocsPageTitle>

<DocsPageLead>
    Give users brief notifications without interrupting their current task.
</DocsPageLead>

<DocsPageParagraph>
    Use the <Code>Toast</Code> component for confirmations, status updates, and other messages that can appear alongside the current page.
</DocsPageParagraph>

<DocsPageSectionTitle>
    Overview
</DocsPageSectionTitle>

<DocsPageParagraph>
    Things to know when using the toast component:
</DocsPageParagraph>

<DocsPageParagraph>
    <UnorderedList>
        <UnorderedListItem>
            <Paragraph>Toasts are opt-in for performance reasons, so <Strong>you must initialize them yourself</Strong>.</Paragraph>
        </UnorderedListItem>
        <UnorderedListItem>
            <Paragraph>Toasts will automatically hide if you do not specify <Code>Autohide="false"</Code>.</Paragraph>
        </UnorderedListItem>
        <UnorderedListItem>
            <Paragraph>Toasts must be wrapped with a <Code Tag>Toaster</Code> component to be properly placed on a screen.</Paragraph>
        </UnorderedListItem>
        <UnorderedListItem>
            <Paragraph>Use the <Anchor To="docs/services/toast-provider" Title="Link to toast service provider">toast service provider</Anchor> to show toasts programmatically with minimal code.</Paragraph>
        </UnorderedListItem>
    </UnorderedList>
</DocsPageParagraph>

<DocsPageSectionTitle>
    Structure
</DocsPageSectionTitle>

<DocsPageParagraph>
    A <Code>Toaster</Code> positions one or more <Code>Toast</Code> notifications. Each toast can contain a header and a message body.
</DocsPageParagraph>

<DocsAnatomy Label="Toast component anatomy">
    <DocsAnatomyRegion Label="Toaster" Description="Positions and groups the notifications.">
        <DocsAnatomyRegion Label="Toast" Description="Controls one notification and its visibility.">
            <DocsAnatomyRegion Label="ToastHeader" Description="Contains the heading and optional supporting details.">
                <DocsAnatomyRegion Label="CloseButton" Description="An optional control for dismissing the notification." />
            </DocsAnatomyRegion>
            <DocsAnatomyRegion Label="ToastBody" Description="Contains the message." />
        </DocsAnatomyRegion>
    </DocsAnatomyRegion>
</DocsAnatomy>

